    "sentence_translations": [
      "Face-Judging Times",
      "",
      "In China, it is becoming more and more common for people to judge others based on the way their face looks.",
      "",
      "If you have a pretty face, you will get more advantages. It might also be much easier for you to handle difficult situations.",
      "A pretty face can solve many problems.",
      "Therefore, many people sigh: “I feel depressed with this face-judging world!”",
      "",
      "However, in times of facial obsession, there are still many people who judge others based on personality.",
      "When selecting a boyfriend or a girlfriend, ..",
      ".. many people still believe kindness, politeness, kind-heartedness and being responsible come ahead of appearance.",
      "A pretty face gradually disappears while good qualities never fade.",
